Directive_ContributeExperiment_Rule=In turn order, each player decides whether to contribute an Experiment. Donated Experiments are turned face-down and placed under your Masterwork card.
Directive_DeclineDonation_Penalty=If a player chooses not to donate, they will **lose a Servant** and **gain 1** {icon:creepy_icon}.
Directive_DiscardExperimentOrUpgrade=Discard a **completed Experiment (of B-Level or higher)** OR **discard an Estate Upgrade Tile** (not a Storage Shed).
