Resource_InsanityTrack_3rdSpace_Lead=If a player reaches the **3rd** space on the {icon:insanity_icon} Track, 
Resource_KnowledgeMovesCreepyTrack_Rule=At the end of each round, each player will **move one space forward on the** {icon:creepy_icon} **Track for each Knowledge cube in their Estate**.
Reward_InsanityTrackSpace_5VP=At the end of the Generation, if your piece is on space {mental} of the {icon:insanity_icon} Track, you will **gain 5VP**.
Reward_LeastCreepy_NobelPrize_Lose7VP=At the End of the Generation, the **least** {icon:creepy_icon} player will be awarded this prestigious award and **lose 7VP.**
Reward_MostHeartTokens_5VP=At the end of the Generation, the player with the most {icon:s1_hearttoken} tokens will gain **5VP.** _If there is a tie, all tied players gain 5VP._
Reward_MostOccultExperiments_SpawningPods=At the end of the Generation, the player with the most completed **Occult** Experiments will receive the **Spawning Pods** Vanity Estate Upgrade.
